// and no attribute 266 or 271 access. The 269 type-14 disc REL resources and the type-19 debugMenuData
// REL module contain no lbz/stb direct displacement access to these two bytes and no imports to the
// raw/BIOS flag accessors, generic attribute APIs or battle VM entries. These results bound the
// missing producer search in this PAL build; intended gameplay semantics remain unproven
